{
  "description": "应用 course.recipes 实际返回的可深改预置。选择反馈含单选/多选，揭示分步，拖拽匹配/排序，continuous-variable-v1连续变量联动；内容配方在已观察页后创建可编辑页面。static-background-v1/dynamic-background-v1仅添加单份全局底层，不新建页，可选current/include/exclude/all范围、图像/颜色/运动强度与内容联动，不抢前景输入。软件装配正式组件、配置、依赖和身份，一次撤销；需要整课写入授权。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "accentTokenId": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
      },
      "recipeId": {
        "enum": [
          "cover-v1",
          "concept-v1",
          "worked-example-v1",
          "step-reveal-v1",
          "choice-feedback-v1",
          "classify-sort-v1",
          "continuous-variable-v1",
          "static-background-v1",
          "dynamic-background-v1"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "slots": {
        "additionalProperties": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "propertyNames": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "target": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "target",
      "recipeId",
      "slots"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "应用互动预置",
    "targetKinds": [
      "course-surface"
    ]
  },
  "name": "surface.recipe",
  "version": 1
}
